---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Personal Injury Attorney | Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in an accident? Sulfab Law Office fights for compensation in personal injury cases throughout San Francisco. Call (415) 360-5266."
  canonical="/personal-injury-lawyer-san-francisco/"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-gold-bar"></div>
        <span class="hero-page-label">Practice Area</span>
        <h1 class="hero-page-title">San Francisco Personal Injury Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="hero-page-subtitle">An unexpected accident can change your life in an instant. Serious injuries often result in mounting medical bills, lost wages, emotional distress, and uncertainty about the future. When an injury is caused by another person's negligence or reckless behavior, you should not have to bear the financial burden alone.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-primary">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Free Case Evaluation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-intro-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-intro-content">
        <p>Personal injury law allows injured individuals to seek compensation when another party's negligence causes harm. However, navigating the legal process can be overwhelming, especially while recovering from an injury. Insurance companies often attempt to minimize payouts, delay claims, or deny liability altogether.</p>
        <p>At The Sulfab Law Office, we are committed to protecting the rights of injury victims throughout San Francisco and the surrounding Bay Area. As an experienced personal injury lawyer in San Francisco, we help clients navigate the legal process, deal with insurance companies, and pursue the maximum compensation available under California law.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="strategic-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="strategic-grid">
        <div class="strategic-sidebar">
          <p class="kicker">Experience Matters</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Strong Legal Advocacy for Injury Victims</h2>
          <div class="gold-bar"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="strategic-content">
          <p>If you've been injured due to someone else's negligence, you deserve strong legal advocacy. Our San Francisco personal injury attorney works diligently to protect your interests from the moment you contact our office. We investigate the accident, gather evidence, evaluate damages, and build a strong claim designed to secure the compensation you deserve.</p>
          <p>Our firm handles every aspect of the legal process, allowing our clients to focus on their recovery while we pursue the compensation they deserve. Whether your injury resulted from a motor vehicle accident, unsafe property conditions, or another act of negligence, our legal team is prepared to advocate aggressively on your behalf.</p>
          <div class="strategic-highlight">
            <p>We are committed to holding responsible parties accountable and ensuring that injury victims receive the full and fair compensation they are entitled to under California law.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-grid-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-grid-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Types of Cases</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Personal Injury Cases We Handle</h2>
        <p class="services-subtitle">We represent clients in a wide range of personal injury matters. Every case is unique, and we take the time to understand the circumstances surrounding your accident and injuries.</p>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Car accidents</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Truck accidents</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Motorcycle accidents</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Slip and fall injuries</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Pedestrian accidents</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Bicycle accidents</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Premises liability</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Dog bite injuries</span></div>
          <div class="service-item"><span class="service-bullet">!</span><span>Wrongful death claims</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">How We Help</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">How We Fight for You</h2>
        <p class="cards-subtitle">We take a comprehensive approach to personal injury representation, handling every aspect of your case with dedication and skill.</p>
        <div class="cards-grid">
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Protect Your Rights</h3>
            <p>Insurance companies often minimize or deny valid claims. We handle all communications and negotiations to ensure your rights are protected throughout the process.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Focus on Recovery</h3>
            <p>By managing the legal complexities of your case, we allow you to focus on what matters most -- your physical and emotional recovery.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Investigate and Build Your Case</h3>
            <p>We conduct thorough investigations, gather evidence, consult with experts, and build strong cases designed to maximize your compensation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Negotiate and Advocate</h3>
            <p>Whether through skilled settlement negotiations or aggressive litigation, we pursue every available avenue to secure the compensation you deserve.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="compensation-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="compensation-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Financial Recovery</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Compensation Available After an Injury</h2>
        <p class="compensation-subtitle">If another party's negligence caused your injuries, you may be entitled to pursue compensation through a personal injury claim.</p>
        <div class="compensation-grid">
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Medical Expenses</h3>
            <p>Coverage for emergency treatment, hospital stays, surgeries, medication, rehabilitation, and future medical care related to your injuries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Lost Wages and Earning Capacity</h3>
            <p>Compensation for lost income, employment benefits, and reduced ability to earn income in the future due to your injuries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Pain, Suffering and More</h3>
            <p>Compensation for physical pain, emotional distress, and other damages such as property loss or wrongful death.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="cta-text">
            <h2>Contact a Personal Injury Lawyer in San Francisco Today</h2>
            <p>If you have been injured due to someone else's negligence, do not wait. Contact Sulfab Law Office today for a free consultation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-cta">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

